bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Favourite Manga Page (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control UserController
control UserService
control JwtService
entity UserModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open favourite list
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /favourites
activate Router

Router -> UserController: 3. getFavourites()
activate UserController
UserController -> UserService: 4. getFavourites(token)
activate UserService

opt No token
    UserService --> UserController: 4.1. Return 400 Bad Request
    UserController --> Router: 4.2. Return 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 4.3. Return 400 Bad Request
    UI --> User: 4.4. Show error
end

UserService -> JwtService: 5. Verify token
activate JwtService
JwtService --> UserService: 6. Decoded
deactivate JwtService

opt Invalid token
    UserService --> UserController: 6.1. Return 400 Bad Request
    UserController --> Router: 6.2. Return 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 6.3. Return 400 Bad Request
    UI --> User: 6.4. Show error
end

UserService -> UserModel: 7. Find user
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 8. Find user
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 9. Reuturn user
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 10. User data
deactivate UserModel

opt User not found
    UserService --> UserController: 10.1. Return 400 Bad Request
    UserController --> Router: 10.2. Return 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 10.3. Return 400 Bad Request
    UI --> User: 10.4. Show error
end

UserService --> UserController: 11. Return favourites list
deactivate UserService

UserController --> Router: 12. HTTP response
deactivate UserController

Router --> UI: 13. Render favourites
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 14. Display favourite mangas
deactivate UI
deactivate User